---
import { siteConfig } from '../data/services';
import { Activity, ShieldCheck, Heart, ArrowUpRight, Github } from 'lucide-astro';
---

<footer class="mt-20 border-t border-warm-border bg-warm-sand/60">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mb-8">
      
      <!-- Col 1: Brand & Desc -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2 space-y-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-warm-accent flex items-center justify-center text-warm-bg font-bold text-xs">
            K
          </div>
          <span class="font-bold text-base text-warm-charcoal tracking-tight">
            kubiko<span class="text-warm-accent">.my.id</span>
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-warm-muted leading-relaxed max-w-md">
          Portal mandiri keluarga untuk hiburan bersama, penyimpanan berkas, dan berbagai utilitas praktis sehari-hari secara aman, cepat, dan nyaman.
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-warm-muted">
          <span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-status-online"></span>
          <span>Akses Mandiri Keluarga • 100% Bebas Iklan</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 2: Akses Cepat -->
      <div class="space-y-2.5">
        <h4 class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-warm-charcoal font-semibold">Tautan Cepat</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-warm-muted">
          <li>
            <a href="https://nonton.kubiko.my.id" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-warm-accent transition-colors flex items-center gap-1">
              Nonton Film & Video
              <ArrowUpRight class="w-3 h-3 opacity-60" />
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://files.kubiko.my.id" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-warm-accent transition-colors flex items-center gap-1">
              Penyimpanan Berkas (Nextcloud)
              <ArrowUpRight class="w-3 h-3 opacity-60" />
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://pdf.kubiko.my.id" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-warm-accent transition-colors flex items-center gap-1">
              Pengolah PDF (Stirling)
              <ArrowUpRight class="w-3 h-3 opacity-60" />
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://crafty.kubiko.my.id" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-warm-accent transition-colors flex items-center gap-1">
              Server Game Minecraft
              <ArrowUpRight class="w-3 h-3 opacity-60" />
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/math-hero" class="hover:text-warm-accent transition-colors flex items-center gap-1">
              Math Hero (Game Edukasi)
              <ArrowUpRight class="w-3 h-3 opacity-60" />
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 3: Kenyamanan & Privasi -->
      <div class="space-y-2.5">
        <h4 class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-warm-charcoal font-semibold">Kenyamanan</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-warm-muted">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-status-online">✓</span>
            <span>Akses Mudah Multi-Perangkat</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-status-online">✓</span>
            <span>Bebas Pelacak & Iklan</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-status-online">✓</span>
            <span>Pemantauan Status Real-Time</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-status-online">✓</span>
            <span>Privasi Data Keluarga Terjaga</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Row -->
    <div class="pt-6 border-t border-warm-border flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-warm-muted">
      <div>
        © {new Date().getFullYear()} <strong class="text-warm-charcoal">kubiko.my.id</strong>. Hak Cipta Terpelihara.
      </div>
      
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <a 
          href={siteConfig.statusPageUrl} 
          target="_blank" 
          rel="noopener noreferrer" 
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 hover:text-warm-accent transition-colors"
        >
          <Activity class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-warm-accent" />
          <span>Status Sistem</span>
        </a>
        <span>•</span>
        <a 
          href="https://github.com/muhaliakbar14-cyber/kubiko" 
          target="_blank" 
          rel="noopener noreferrer" 
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 hover:text-warm-charcoal transition-colors"
        >
          <Github class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
          <span>GitHub</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
